WEBVTT

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:17.720
Faces will lose their
sense of self in due time,

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.020
becoming but faithful
servants of their shadows.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:27.770
Then shall shadow and face
unite as a complete being.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:33.280
In that sense, it calls into question
the methods of Edward's debut.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:37.320
It's a mistake to have shadows
be friendly with their face.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:41.580
Faces are meant to be taken.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:45.830
Having faces rescue their masters
creates an emotional bond

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:49.920
and encourages them
to think for themselves.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:53.840
Is it not important to promote loyalty?

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:59.010
However, a debut that could
cause them all to fail is quite a risk.

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:00.600
Quite the experiment.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.850
Some are showing signs
of new powers blossoming.

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:07.980
In that respect,
Sophie looks favorably upon Edward.

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:10.150
Do you wish to mass produce Star Bearers?

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:13.610
No good will come of having
them ponder matters to no avail.

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:18.700
This means there are yet many
possibilities here in Shadows House.

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:22.370
What an interesting debut.

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:25.410
Edward's methodology is revolutionary.

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:28.380
It will be difficult
for him to judge swiftly.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:32.050
Bah! That Edward makes one's blood boil.

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:34.720
He's rolled out quite
the lavish performance.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:37.300
Is he trying to steal Ryan's thunder?

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:39.430
No, no.

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:40.970
However...

00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:42.510
that was uncalled for.

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:45.430
The union of bodies is
this house's great secret.

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:49.860
It was foolish to do so
where the candidates might see.

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:53.820
Ed, you have sunk too far
into your own world.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:55.570
Aileen!

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:56.990
Yes, ma'am.

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:05.160
What becomes of these five pairs
upon the debut's conclusion

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:08.170
shall be a sight to see.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:38.880
<b>"A Bird Cage and Flowers"</b>

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:42.300
<b>"A Bird Cage and Flowers"</b>

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:43.470
Oh, how wonderful it feels
to have clean clothes once more.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:45.720
That soot remover is superb!

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:50.100
There would be no need to change
three times a day with one of those!

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:53.900
Then there's this map.
This debut is so much fun!

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.110
Well, Shaun?

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:57.770
Can we get through those bars?

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.740
I figured it out.

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:02.910
They're locked by this
bar sunk into the ground.

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:05.370
They should turn if we lift it.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:11.160
But there's also a bar on the other side.
Both have to be lifted at the same time.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:14.540
We can't move the bars
without someone on the other side?

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:18.500
There's nothing we can do.
We'll have to take a detour.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.090
We can check on Mistress Kate on the way.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:23.720
No, John's not going to meet with her.

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:26.600
He promised not to
until he passed this test.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.640
Then we won't--

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:30.470
But John would save her if she asked!

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:39.110
You're the last person I wanted to see.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:40.690
Huh?

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.240
Oh, I get it.

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:50.490
Shaun, you want to get to this side.

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:54.000
Get down on your knees
and beg. Then I'll help you.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:58.090
If you came from that direction,
you want to get to this 

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:01.050
No. I've already saved Master Patrick.

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:04.380
I'm just killing time
with a little stroll.

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:05.590
Is that Patrick's face?

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:07.010
Master John?!

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:12.350
That's right. I've figured out more
of the labyrinth than you, Ricky.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.810
I even know where Master Patrick is.

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:16.850
All your bluster was in vain.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:23.110
Considering where you are right now,
you haven't yet saved him.

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:25.570
Shaun, would you mind answering this?

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:26.950
Yes?

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:30.580
Doesn't having your master here
give you an unfair advantage?

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:33.580
John wants to learn about
the relations between dolls.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:36.620
So please proceed as if John weren't here.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.880
But Ricky would obey you
if you told him to.

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:45.130
What a unique shadow master.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:48.640
In any case, I've got the advantage.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:51.640
We still have plenty of time,
even with a detour.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.640
I already know most of the paths.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:58.150
You, however, have a long way to go
before you'll see Master Patrick.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:02.270
Your path will take you
about twice around the garden.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:03.570
I'll tell you what.

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:08.780
If you apologize for hitting me,
I'll lend you a hand.

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:11.240
One point for Shaun.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:13.370
Not so fast.

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:17.000
From what you said,
can I assume Master Patrick is here?

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.670
I really had no idea.

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:23.300
I must thank you for
your loose lipped leak.

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:26.550
One point for Ricky.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:29.470
I'm done wasting time here.

00:06:29.470 --> 00:06:30.680
Let's go, Master.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:34.100
W-Wait! I'll apologize!

00:06:35.140 --> 00:06:37.560
Hitting you was wrong.

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:42.230
That was utterly insincere, but drawing
this out will only waste more time.

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:47.030
Emilico would probably help him,
no questions asked.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:49.820
All right, let's open the gate.

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:53.280
What? But it's still a two to two tie.

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:54.870
Enough with that!

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:58.540
And when did we each score another point?!

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:01.750
Okay, we'll lift the bars together.

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:06.880
Aren't those the shears Lou chose?

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:10.300
Ricky, what have you done to her?

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:13.100
Lou gave them to me.

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:16.560
I swear upon Master Patrick
that I'm not lying.

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:19.640
Why would Lou give you her shears?

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:23.020
You've tried to trick people into
doing your bidding the entire time.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:26.110
I can't trust you.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.780
Wait! Answer my question!

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:31.360
You won't believe me no matter what I say.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:34.660
That's the same as
insulting Master Patrick!

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:43.170
Mistress Louise has arrived!

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:46.090
To think we'd be greeted
so grandly at the exit!

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:50.090
How fine it feels to come in first.

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:52.550
There's Barbie.

00:07:57.180 --> 00:08:00.600
Louise made it out. That means...

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:03.770
Ricky was telling the truth.

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:12.820
Oh, you're a sight for sore eyes, Lou.
Let's see that face.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:16.830
A living doll would never
lay hands on a shadow master.

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:22.790
I'm not some fool who'd let a moment
of passion disgrace Master Patrick.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:24.710
Ricky.

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:30.050
Here.

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:31.880
Mistress Louise's orders?

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:35.220
No, it has nothing to do
with Mistress Louise.

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:37.930
It's a secret.

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:41.100
I wanted you to have them.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:48.480
I've never done such a thing before.
It feels strange.

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:51.860
But I had fun while I was with you.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:54.280
I want you and Master Patrick

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:56.820
to make it past the debut.

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:01.830
Ricky!

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:05.040
I owe you an apology.
I'm sorry for doubting you!

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.420
Come back!

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:14.170
You will abandon this
path out of pride, Ricky?

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:18.220
The path you've chosen
doesn't lead to the finish line.

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:21.680
It's all over for you.

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:31.730
That half-wit was right.
I've no chance if I take this detour.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:33.570
Damn it.

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:40.240
Ricky came back.

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:42.790
Huh?!

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:44.750
What?!

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.210
Boulder!

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:52.750
Lift the bar on your side!

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:56.510
I'd like to, but then
I'd be the one in danger!

00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:59.090
Hang on! I'll think of something.

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:03.560
Take care of Master Patrick.

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:09.020
He's quite sensitive.
I fear for him once I'm gone.

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:12.070
Who knows what will
happen if he fails the debut.

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:15.690
But if he does survive this...

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:20.160
Master John! Shaun! Please help him!

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:25.790
Master John!

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.170
This body has a mind of its own.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:30.540
This can't be happening! Master John!

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:32.960
Master John!

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:48.850
Nice face, Ricky. That's three points!

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:51.100
What just happened?

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.650
How very marvelous.

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:59.360
Such a great volume of soot.
If only I could get a closer look.

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:01.450
Oh, John! So very irresistible!

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:03.990
I wonder what he tastes like.

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:07.790
Hey, Sophie. You're so excited,
your face is showing.

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:09.080
Her face is showing?

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:10.920
So it seems.

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:17.340
To liven up the moment is a fine thing.

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:19.590
So they say.

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:24.810
Sophie, you utterly change when
it comes to soot. It's frightening.

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:32.600
At last, the end of the debut draws near.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:36.230
Hey, why are these three going in circles?

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:40.110
John went to the other side,
and now he must get back.

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:44.370
But he can't rejoin Shaun
unless Ricky goes back.

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:47.660
A heroic effort wasted by a feeble fool.

00:11:47.660 --> 00:11:49.870
And Rum...

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:52.540
She's advancing after some confusion.

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:55.630
That is the tunnel Ricky did not take.

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:58.590
Did Sunshine put some
funny ideas in her head?

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:00.630
She's become positively heroic.

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:03.510
John and Shaun are heading for the exit.

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:07.470
And Ricky and Rum are
reuniting with their masters.

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:12.140
The living dolls are growing up
by overcoming many difficulties.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:16.570
He's so pleased, he's chatting up a storm.
But can he open the crate?

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:19.320
What does it matter? It's adorable.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:22.740
He has noticed something.

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:27.780
The various confines Edward
designed all have soot as their key.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:32.540
Ricky has found a mold for
making a key from hardened soot.

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:36.840
John was also in a crate,
but he used his power to destroy it.

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:41.970
It seems Ricky has learned by seeing
Louise's rescue and John's wondrous power.

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:44.010
Truly magnificent.

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:47.050
Well, he's soundly cleared that hurdle.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:52.230
The shadows gain trust toward their faces
and praise them for their efforts.

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:54.560
Thus their bond deepens.

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:59.480
Shirley has yet to emit any soot.

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:02.030
This may prove difficult.

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:08.280
What's this? Is she channeling Sunshine?

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:11.580
She better be careful.
The sap will splatter all over.

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:13.500
This is too scary to watch.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:16.670
Doesn't she know it causes a burning rash?

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:20.500
Like Kate's cage, the upper area
comes loose if exposed to soot.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.090
The rash causing flowers
were meant to fall on her.

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.050
She found a workaround.

00:13:25.050 --> 00:13:29.600
Rum seemed quite wishy washy,
but she is unexpectedly resolute.

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:32.980
It's an act of loyalty toward Shirley.

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:45.280
What's this? Is Shirley speaking?

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:49.280
An emotional reunion.
How unfortunate we cannot hear them.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:51.620
The worst candidates staged a comeback.

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:54.080
Patrick and Ricky took a detour,

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.620
but at this rate,
they'll likely make it in time.

00:13:56.620 --> 00:14:00.040
The grand finale to
a most beauteous debut.

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:04.380
They better not all make it
merrily holding hands!

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:07.300
Ryan couldn't stomach
such an imbecilic ending!

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:08.680
Well, Gerald?!

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:10.050
Aileen?!

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:14.180
Shadows House is not so kind as
to keep the incompetent around.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:18.650
The fact is that at every debut,
there have been useless individuals.

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:22.400
Edward has failed in his task
if he cannot find them.

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:26.950
Now, now, Ryan. It is not over yet, is it?

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.910
They are still in play.

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:32.700
The most pitiful of all.

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:35.040
Mistress Kate!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:36.580
Mistress Kate.

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:38.870
It is you.

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:43.590
No, I mustn't cry yet.

00:14:43.590 --> 00:14:45.260
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:48.630
I was so worried.
I couldn't wait to see you again.

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:53.600
Forgive me. I imagine this made you
far more anxious than I was.

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:56.930
No, but it would've
been nice to have a book.

00:14:56.930 --> 00:14:58.890
It was so dull here.

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:02.060
But you must have had
a terrible time getting here.

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:07.110
That's right! Lots and
lots of stuff happened!

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:08.990
Please do tell.

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:12.120
We were told to proceed
through the garden alone.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:13.830
It must've been so lonely.

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:16.080
I saw lots of strange puzzles and traps.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:19.250
We would've had fun strolling
through it together.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.120
Kate wishes she could have.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:26.340
I met other masters and dolls,
and together we solved some mysteries!

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:27.340
Really?

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:30.680
John came across Kate. He is an odd one.

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:34.600
I saw him, too. He was a lot of fun.

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:36.100
Would you like an orange?

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:37.810
Maybe later.

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:39.730
Oh, what a wonderful apron.

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:44.190
Hurray! I made it
hoping that you'd like it!

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:47.230
Seeing you look like you
always do is reassuring.

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:53.320
This test has shown me that all the dolls
hold their masters dear, just as I do.

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:54.490
That's right.

00:15:54.490 --> 00:15:56.830
And I defeated a bunch of scorches!

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:59.580
You had to do such a thing? Are you hurt?

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:00.790
I'm fine!

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.670
What did you think about while you waited?

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:07.550
Giving you that bread you love so much.

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:14.720
Let's continue this later over
a cup of tea in Kate's room.

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:16.140
Yes, ma'am!

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:19.470
Kate has something to talk to you about.

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:23.310
There's that bell again.

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.520
Someone must have passed.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:27.900
You can just see the exit from here.

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:31.570
It's not clear who,
but someone is being greeted.

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:35.700
Now about how Kate ended up in here.

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:40.750
The controls for this cage are on
the other side of the thorn trees.

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:44.710
Edward said,
"It is necessary for the debut."

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:46.960
There was no choice but to get in.

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:49.000
As he operated the controls,

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.550
the crane started to move

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:53.720
until it hung on the other side.

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:55.930
The cage itself is the problem.

00:16:55.930 --> 00:17:00.180
As soot enters the ceiling vent,
the chains by which it's hung break.

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:03.060
It's only hanging by five chains now.

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:05.400
Oh, no! We must do something quick!

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:08.110
How do I get over there?

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:11.070
There is a path behind the cage.

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:14.740
But the entrance is locked.

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:19.410
Edward said the key will be
available at the sootglass plaza.

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:24.540
The keys! He must mean those!

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:27.710
You don't have them?

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:29.670
There was but one chance.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:34.630
Out of my great benevolence,
I gave you one chance of passing.

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:37.390
You had to choose the keys at the start.

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:43.390
You were doomed to fail the moment
you left the sootglass plaza.

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:45.640
Emilico, what are you doing?

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:49.520
I can reach the controls
through these thorn trees, right?

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:51.530
Well yes.

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:53.070
That's true, but...

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:57.410
Then if I can cut through here,
I can save you!

00:17:57.410 --> 00:18:00.240
You never give up, do you, Emilico?

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:02.870
Kate likes that about you.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:06.330
Mistress Kate!

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.460
I better hurry!

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:10.170
But...

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.720
there's no time.

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:18.970
Yes! I knew Emilico wouldn't give up.

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:20.680
How marvelous!

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:26.560
Show the third floor masters how
you struggle in vain until the very end!

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:27.980
Mistress Kate!

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:31.440
Only two chains left!

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:36.030
Emilico is trying her hardest, but I...

00:18:36.030 --> 00:18:37.860
Emilico.

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:39.910
Someone's coming.

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.580
Ricky.

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:49.420
Patrick? Why now?

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:53.210
Those are the shears
that Lou chose, aren't they?

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:55.340
It's a long story.

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:58.630
Did he steal them from Louise?
I wouldn't be surprised.

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:02.930
He must think that eliminating rivals
gives him an edge.

00:19:02.930 --> 00:19:05.890
I knew we couldn't trust the others pairs.

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:07.890
What a relief!

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:11.190
That bell or the one before it
must've been for Lou!

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:16.860
Lou gave you the shears to thank you
for helping her, didn't she?

00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:24.580
Mistress Kate! Are you all right?!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.370
Y-Yes, but...

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:31.040
I'm afraid I can't talk right now.
There's something I must do!

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:41.340
Give Emilico the shears.

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:44.890
There is a debt to pay.

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:49.560
Thank you!

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:52.350
I will save Mistress Kate!

00:19:53.480 --> 00:19:59.530
Shaun, Rum, Ricky, and Lou
are all supporting our efforts!

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:03.030
But it didn't start out like that.

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:05.660
They changed because of you.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.330
I was a fool.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:11.580
From the very start,
I was making enemies, not friends.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:15.500
Emilico! It will take too long
to cut it all down.

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:18.960
Just cut enough to get through.
Careful you don't get hurt!

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.800
Yes, ma'am!

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:27.010
Mistress Kate!
I've reached the crane's controls.

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:29.220
Well done! Do you know how to use it?

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:32.690
Oh, no! I need a key here, too!

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:35.520
But...

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:38.360
Oh, no! The soot is...

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:41.240
It's no use.

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:43.450
The soot won't stop.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:45.660
At any moment, I'll be...

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:47.240
I'm scared.

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:49.450
I'm scared!

00:20:49.450 --> 00:20:51.330
I'm so scared!

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:53.710
I won't give up!

00:20:57.380 --> 00:21:00.170
I'll save you no matter what!

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:01.920
Emilico!

00:21:15.270 --> 00:21:19.020
Mistress Kate!

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:28.330
Mistress Kate, give me your hand!

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:45.800
Mia once told me that
she was born brilliant, but...

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:50.140
in my case, it seems I was
born with a sturdy body!

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:24.900
How very thrilling.

00:23:24.900 --> 00:23:27.240
It is getting quite interesting.

00:23:27.240 --> 00:23:28.570
Interesting?

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:31.450
It's just made them
fret over trivial matters.

00:23:31.450 --> 00:23:34.370
Ryan was looking forward
to their spectacular deaths!

00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:36.620
Nevertheless...

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:39.250
Is this not the end?

00:23:39.250 --> 00:23:41.750
And their end as well?

00:23:48.970 --> 00:23:51.800
Next episode, "The Final Pair."
